  /// Reads all of `text` as a decimal `u64`.
  ///
  /// # Details
  ///
  /// `text` must contain only the digits `0` to `9`. Signs, spaces, and separators are not
  /// accepted. Leading zeros are accepted.
  ///
  /// # Errors
